WEBVTT

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.684
child marriage.

00:08:30.708 --> 00:08:32.643
So by working and focusing here,

00:08:32.667 --> 00:08:35.143
you can actually create
a large multiplier effect

00:08:35.167 --> 00:08:37.768
across all of these indicators.

00:08:37.792 --> 00:08:39.058
And it would mean

00:08:39.082 --> 00:08:43.457
that we would be able to bring back
1.6 million girls back into school.

00:08:44.792 --> 00:08:50.875
(Applause)

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:55.184
I have to say, I have been
doing this for over a decade,

00:08:55.208 --> 00:09:00.018
and I have never met a girl
who said to me,